SRD art manifest and badges
===========================

Copyright B4mad Technologies and Spellkave contributors.

The badge images in `badge/` are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

They are original Spellkave material, generated with PixelLab. Each
`.png.json` sidecar records the generator, prompt and SHA-256. The
composites in `../assets/srd-art/` place these badges on base sprites.
`art-manifest.json` is first-party data under the same licence.
